# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback. Every unknown path serves index.html so
# client-side routing (app.js) can dispatch /projects, /travels/peru, etc.
# This is the canonical SPA pattern from CF docs:
#   https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/#single-page-application-spa-rendering
# `wrangler pages dev` warns "infinite loop detected" — that's a known
# false positive (it sees `/index.html` matched by `/*`); production
# handles it correctly. Trade-off: unknown paths now soft-404 (200 with
# welcome screen) rather than hard-404. Acceptable for a personal site.
/*  /index.html  200
